# Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Houses of Hermes: Societates — House Tytalus (Lore)

**Version:** 0.5.1
**Source:** Houses of Hermes: Societates (Atlas Games) — Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Chapter Three (pp. 71–100)
**Publisher:** Atlas Games

> Chapter Three’s narrative, verbatim: House Tytalus’s history and betrayal, its philosophy of
> conflict, its culture and apprenticeship, its cabals and intrigues, and the two groups within
> it. The chapter’s mechanics are structured records elsewhere — the debate system in
> `armdef-houses-societates-0.5-tytalus.ttrpg`; the spells in `armdef-houses-societates-0.5-tytalus-spells.ttrpg`; the new Virtues and Flaws
> in `armdef-houses-societates-0.5-tytalus-virtues-flaws.ttrpg`; the sidebars as GUIDANCE and TABLE records in
> `armdef-houses-societates-0.5-tytalus-sidebars.ttrpg`. The House itself is the canonical `^"House Tytalus"` DEF in
> `armdef-0.5-houses.ttrpg`.

